# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DO NOT add an apex -> www redirect here.
#
# Netlify's Domain management has haggertyutah.com (apex) set as the PRIMARY
# domain, so Netlify itself 301s www -> apex at the domain layer, BEFORE this
# file is consulted. A rule here sending apex -> www therefore creates an
# infinite loop (www -> apex -> www -> ...) and takes the whole site down with
# ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS. That is exactly what happened between 2026-07-21 and
# 2026-08-25.
#
# The canonical host is now the apex (haggertyutah.com) — see src/_data/client.json.
# If you ever want www to be canonical, change the PRIMARY DOMAIN in the Netlify
# dashboard and update client.json to match. Change one place, never both.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
